WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.551
Every day, thousands of shoppers walk through your store.

2
00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.903
Almost all of them leave like ghosts.

3
00:00:06.903 --> 00:00:07.588
No name.

4
00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:08.571
No trace.

5
00:00:09.221 --> 00:00:10.431
Follow one.

6
00:00:11.631 --> 00:00:14.582
From her very first click, Convertive reads every move.

7
00:00:14.582 --> 00:00:15.839
Where she came from.

8
00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:16.855
What she wants.

9
00:00:16.855 --> 00:00:18.750
When she starts to hesitate.

10
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.761
Thirty-two seconds in, she's about to leave.

11
00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:24.096
So Convertive stops the clock.

12
00:00:24.096 --> 00:00:25.727
It weighs every next move,

13
00:00:25.727 --> 00:00:27.969
and picks the one most likely to work.

14
00:00:27.969 --> 00:00:29.850
In forty-one milliseconds.

15
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:31.214
One offer.

16
00:00:31.214 --> 00:00:31.978
One email.

17
00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:33.708
And the ghost has a name.

18
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:35.215
Forty-seven seconds.

19
00:00:35.215 --> 00:00:36.384
Order placed.

20
00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:40.963
Now imagine that, for every visitor, in every session.

21
00:00:42.313 --> 00:00:43.150
Convertive.

22
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.912
Convert anonymous visitors before they leave.
